| moduleIdREQUIRED | string | Mindtickle ID of the module. |

JSON REQUEST PARAMETERS

| Name | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| learnerReviewers | Array[UserReviewer] | For assigning reviewers to one or more users. |
| userId | string | Mindtickle ID of the user to whom you want to assign reviewers. |
| reviewersidindex | Array[Reviewer] | Reviewers that you want to assign to the user. |
| string | string | Mindtickle ID of the reviewer. |
| integer | string | Reviewer’s index. Define who will be Reviewer 1, Reviewer 2, and so on. This is especially helpful when you are replacing reviewers and want to ensure that you’re replacing correct reviewers against those configured through the reviewer appointment method in module settings. |

