Help & Support > Help Center Home > Integrations > Mindtickle MCP server > Connect to the Mindtickle MCP server:
Configure your AI client to connect to the Mindtickle MCP server using the access token generated in the previous step.

Server URL

```
https://{mindtickle-instance-url}/mcp
```

Required headers

| Header | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| AuthorizationREQUIRED | string | The Bearer token in the format Bearer <access_token>. |

Example client configuration

```json

{
  "mcpServers": {
    "mindtickle": {
      "url": "https://{mindtickle-instance-url}/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

